{
  "key": 39226,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_ImTheDayCareMan",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Day-Care Man.\r",
        "We look after the precious Pokémon\n",
        "of other Trainers.\r",
        "If you’d like us to raise your\n",
        "Pokémon, have a word with my wife."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis l’Hôte de la Pension.\r",
        "Nous bichonnons les Pokémon\n",
        "chéris des Dresseurs.\r",
        "Va voir ma femme si tu veux\n",
        "nous confier tes Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PokemonHoldingEggYouWantIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it’s you!\r",
        "We were raising your Pokémon,\n",
        "and my goodness, were we surprised!\r",
        "Your Pokémon was holding an Egg!\r",
        "We don’t know how it got there,\n",
        "but your Pokémon had it.\r",
        "You do want it, don’t you?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, c’est toi!\r",
        "On a eu une surprise en élevant tes\n",
        "Pokémon!\r",
        "Un beau matin, l’un d’entre eux est\n",
        "venu avec un Oeuf!\r",
        "On ne sait pas où il l’a trouvé,\n",
        "mais c’est celui de ton Pokémon.\r",
        "Tu comptes le prendre, n’est-ce pas?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PokemonIsDoingJustFine",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\n",
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}’s doing just fine."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, c’est toi! Content de te voir. Ton\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} se porte comme un charme."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_IllHangOnToIt",
      "en_US": [
        "Well then, I’ll hang on to it.\n",
        "Thanks!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Dans ce cas, je vais m’en occuper.\n",
        "Merci bien!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_YouHaveNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "You have no room for it right now...\n",
        "Come back when you’ve made room."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu n’as pas de place, on dirait...\n",
        "Reviens plus tard."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PlayerReceivedEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received the Egg from\n",
        "the Day-Care Man."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient l’Oeuf de la part\n",
        "de l’Hôte de la Pension."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TakeGoodCareOfIt",
      "en_US": "You take good care of it.",
      "fr_FR": "Prends-en bien soin."
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_SawPokemonReceivingMail",
      "en_US": [
        "By the way, I saw your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "cavorting with {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}’s\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}.\r",
        "I may even have seen it receiving\n",
        "a piece of Mail."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Au fait, ton {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} a l’air\n",
        "de bien s’entendre avec le {STRVAR_1 0, 2, 0}\f",
        "de {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Je crois même qu’il a reçu\n",
        "une Lettre."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TalkToWifeToPickUpPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want to pick up your Pokémon,\n",
        "have a word with my wife."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parle à ma femme si tu veux\n",
        "récupérer ton Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PokemonAreDoingJustFine",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it’s you!\n",
        "Good to see you!\r",
        "Your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\n",
        "are doing just fine.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, c’est toi!\n",
        "Content de te voir!\r",
        "Ton {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} et ton {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}\n",
        "se portent bien.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_YouDoWantThisYes",
      "en_US": [
        "I really will keep it.\n",
        "You do want this, yes?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je vais vraiment le garder.\n",
        "Tu le veux, ou pas?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TheTwoGetAlongVeryWell",
      "en_US": "The two seem to get along very well.",
      "fr_FR": "Ils ont l’air de très bien s’entendre."
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TheTwoGetAlong",
      "en_US": "The two seem to get along.",
      "fr_FR": "Ils ont l’air de s’entendre."
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TheTwoDontLikeEachOther",
      "en_US": [
        "The two don’t seem to like each\n",
        "other much."
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Ils ont l’air de ne pas s’aimer."
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TheTwoPlayWithOtherPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "The two prefer to play with other\n",
        "Pokémon more than with each other."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ils préfèrent jouer avec d’autres\n",
        "Pokémon plutôt qu’ensemble."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_ImTheDayCareLadyRaisePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m the Day-Care Lady.\n",
        "We can raise Pokémon for you.\r",
        "Would you like us to raise your\n",
        "Pokémon?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Je suis l’Hôtesse de la Pension.\n",
        "Nous pouvons élever des Pokémon\f",
        "pour toi.\r",
        "Tu veux qu’on en élève un?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_RaiseWhichPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon should we raise for\n",
        "you?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Quel Pokémon veux-tu que l’on élève?\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_WellRaiseYourPokemon_ArrowPrompt",
      "en_US": [
        "Fine, we’ll raise your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "for a while.\r",
        "Come back for it later.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Très bien, nous allons nous occuper de\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} pendant quelque temps.\r",
        "Reviens le chercher plus tard.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_RaiseAnotherPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "We can raise two of your Pokémon.\n",
        "Would you like us to raise another?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Nous pouvons élever deux Pokémon.\n",
        "Tu veux qu’on en élève un autre?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_HusbandWasLookingForYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, there you are!\n",
        "My husband was looking for you."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, te voilà!\n",
        "Mon mari te cherchait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_OhFineThen",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, fine, then.\n",
        "Come again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh, très bien.\n",
        "Reviens plus tard, dans ce cas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_NotEnoughMoney",
      "en_US": "You don’t have enough money...",
      "fr_FR": "Tu n’as pas assez d’argent..."
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_DoYouWantOtherBackToo",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to take back the other\n",
        "one, too?"
      ],
      "fr_FR": "Veux-tu également récupérer l’autre?"
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_VeryGoodComeAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Very good.\n",
        "Come again."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Très bien.\n",
        "A une prochaine fois."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_AboutYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, it’s you! Good to see you.\n",
        "Now, about your Pokémon...\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah, c’est toi! Ravie de te voir.\n",
        "A propos...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PokemonHasGrownXLevels",
      "en_US": [
        "By level, your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} has\n",
        "grown by about {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0}.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ton {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} est monté\n",
        "de {STRVAR_1 51, 1, 0} niveau(x).\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TeamIsFull",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Pokémon team is full.\n",
        "Make room, then come see me."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ton équipe Pokémon est au complet.\n",
        "Fais de la place et reviens me voir."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_TakeBackWhichPokemon",
      "en_US": "Which Pokémon will you take back?",
      "fr_FR": "Quel Pokémon veux-tu récupérer?"
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PokemonBackCostsX",
      "en_US": [
        "If you want your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} back,\n",
        "it will cost ${STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0}."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si tu veux récupérer ton {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0},\n",
        "tu dois payer {STRVAR_1 53, 1, 0} $."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_HeresYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Excellent!\n",
        "Here’s your Pokémon.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parfait!\n",
        "Voilà ton Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_PlayerTookPokemonBack",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} took {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} back\n",
        "from the Day-Care Lady.\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} reprend le {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}\n",
        "à l’Hôtesse de la Pension.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_OnlyOnePokemonWithYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? But you only have one\n",
        "Pokémon with you.\r",
        "You can’t go off without a Pokémon.\n",
        "Come back another time."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh? Mais tu n’as qu’un Pokémon.\r",
        "Tu ne peux pas repartir sans Pokémon.\n",
        "Reviens une autre fois."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_DoYouWantPokemonBack",
      "en_US": "Do you want your Pokémon back?",
      "fr_FR": "Veux-tu reprendre ton Pokémon?"
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_WhatWillYouBattleWith",
      "en_US": [
        "If you leave me that Pokémon,\n",
        "what are you gonna battle with?\r",
        "Come back another time."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Si tu me laisses ce Pokémon, comment\n",
        "vas-tu faire pour te battre?\r",
        "Reviens me voir une autre fois."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_YoullBeLeftWithJustOne",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? Now, now.\r",
        "If you leave that Pokémon with\n",
        "me, you’ll be left with just one.\r",
        "You will be better off if you catch\n",
        "some more, if I do say so myself."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hein?\n",
        "Bon.\r",
        "Si tu me laisses ce Pokémon, il ne\n",
        "t’en restera qu’un.\r",
        "Je te conseille d’en attraper\n",
        "quelques-uns de plus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "DayCareCommon_Text_ThatIsMerelyAnEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, now.\n",
